#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "books/Mining My Soul.txt"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\tMining My Soul\n"
"\tAnonymous Miner\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Mining, mining, mining my soul,\n"
"Working for Barons takes a mental toll\n"
"\n"
"On top of the taxes, \n"
"and the low wages,\n"
"He promised us work, \n"
"but locked us in cages\n"
"\n"
"I sought work for my life,\n"
"not to lose my wife,\n"
"and eat rats in my strife\n"
"\n"
"Always be wary,\n"
"of silver-tongued leaders\n"
"Your reward may just be,\n"
"Bullies and beaters\n"
"\n"
"Don't give them your life,\n"
"Stay in control,\n"
"\n"
"or they'll end up mining, \n"
"\n"
"Mining... \n"
"\n"
"Mining your soul."
msgstr ""

