msgstr ""

#. Versiones: 4.3.2, 5.0.2
msgctxt "books/Worker's Journal, Entry 4.txt"
msgid ""
"Day 15\n"
"\n"
"We're all dying down here. Although I, having accepted my fate, have learned to maneuver and thrive in the darkness, the others seem to have not. Not sure why. Also, they tend to kill each other over things like food and water, or themselves for being scared and depressed. Quite savage, really. Glad I managed to be happy with the mines. I don't mind eating dirt, it tastes quite good actually. If the others would only give it a try...\n"
msgstr ""

